<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts gaming stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts gaming stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Joe Coccimiglio initiated coverage of several gaming stocks, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- Initiated with buy ratings were: Circus Circus Enterprises Inc, ITT Corp, International Game Technology, Hilton Hotels Corp, MGM Grand Inc and Mirage Resorts Inc.  </p>
<p>-- Also started with buy ratings were: Primadonna Resorts Inc and lodging company Promus Hotel Corp.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
